{"3570400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wall Town Wonders", "steam_appid": 3570400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Town wonders is a cosy life sim where you build a charming town from the ground up, guide quirky characters through delightful quests, and customize every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, build, and fall in love with your town like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dating feature added: choose how you let your Towns Folk date!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virtual reality cosy life sim city builder:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where you will experience MR like never before, with unique interactions and highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gentle and Relaxing Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, discover, and nurture your town at your own pace in a tranquil and soothing environment, perfect for unwinding and relaxation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/57b3a4ed6da25c6de2d62b2197d07dd0.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/57b3a4ed6da25c6de2d62b2197d07dd0.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/57b3a4ed6da25c6de2d62b2197d07dd0.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Customization and Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect countless new looks and customization options for your city through gameplay and exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/53c9829fcd9ab36c6a4a0075dd95f729.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/53c9829fcd9ab36c6a4a0075dd95f729.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/53c9829fcd9ab36c6a4a0075dd95f729.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall Town wonders is a cosy life sim where you build a charming town from the ground up, guide quirky characters through delightful quests, and customize every detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, build, and fall in love with your town like never before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dating feature added: choose how you let your Towns Folk date!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/529ba4f3b4bcaab7efa6ae6ec3293cb1.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Virtual reality cosy life sim city builder:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where you will experience MR like never before, with unique interactions and highly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.poster.avif?t=1765795518\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.webm?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570400/extras/2f09f0bf8159a1b4f579cf2bcd003038.mp4?t=1765795518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gentle and Relaxing Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, discover, and nurture your town at your own pace in a tranquil and soothing environment, perfect for unwinding and relaxation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn